  "_about": "Clean-up rules applied by scripts/finalise_breakdown.py after map_labels.py. Rules run in order; each matches on any of broad / specific (exact) / label_regex (case-insensitive, on the free-text context label) and moves matching mentions to the 'to' category. Afterwards, new associations with fewer than min_mentions mentions are folded into 'Other (smaller associations)' within their broad category.",
